{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把一心软就想起受过的气、害怕忘记离开原因，偏写成了不敢轻易怀念过去。原稿并不是不敢回忆好日子，而是既舍不得，又需要提醒自己为何离开。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把情绪概括为释然、平和，显得过于圆满。原稿明确保留了犹疑、疲惫和想念，也写到脚步向前时地面短暂倾斜，强调的是带着未消失的伤痛继续生活，而不是已经彻底释然。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲故事的核心、人物心理变化及最终选择都准确对应完整稿：他既承认过去的亲近与快乐，也不否认曾经受过的委屈，最终带着想念继续生活，不再为了陪伴牺牲自己。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cb9b149c-b960-491b-b537-3746d031c586", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T203231039608Z", "elapsed_seconds": 137.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T20:34:48.258539+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "tem